        "original_id": "3933340a-5347-52bf-91f8-c8330e01f4f1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Bitter Jester, The Future of Food, Hollywood Outlaw: The Unmaking of a Bitter Jester\n- People: Richard Pryor, Richard Belzer, Deborah Koons Garcia\n- Topics: comedy world, genetically engineered foods, documentary films, scandal\n\nFacts:\n- The Future of Food is a 2004 American documentary film written and directed by Deborah Koons Garcia.\n- The Future of Food investigates unlabeled, patented, genetically engineered foods sold in United States grocery stores over the previous decade.\n- Bitter Jester is a portrait of the comedy world that includes interviews with stars such as Richard Pryor and Richard Belzer.\n- Hollywood Outlaw: The Unmaking of a Bitter Jester is the director’s cut of the documentary Bitter Jester.\n- Bitter Jester was buried in 2004 amid scandal and was then never seen again.",
